### Health check
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/health/

### Get notes
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/notes/

### Get flashcards
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/flashcards/

### Get progress
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/progress/

### Complete review
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/review/complete/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "score": 4,
  "total_questions": 5,
  "xp_earned": 125
}

### New Note
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/notes/
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "title": "Django REST Framework",
    "content": "DRF helps Django expose data through API endpoints.",
    "tag": "Programming"
}

### Register a new user
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/auth/register/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "display_name": "Ro",
  "email": "ro@example.com",
  "password": "securedpass123"
}


### Login the user created above
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/auth/login/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "ro@example.com",
  "password": "securedpass123"
}

### Test login with wrong credentials
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/auth/login/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "ro@example.com",
  "password": "wrongpassword"
}

### Test current user
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/auth/me/
Authorization: Bearer replace-access_token-with-the-access-token-you-received-during-login

### Test refresh
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/auth/refresh/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refresh": "replace-refresh_token-with-the-refresh-token-you-received-during-login"
}

### Test logout
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/auth/logout/
Authorization: Bearer replace-access_token-with-the-access-token-you-received-during-login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refresh": "replace-refresh_token-with-the-refresh-token-you-received-during-login"
}